id: pm-rl-release-gate
title: Release readiness behind PM_RELEASE_APPROVED
description: "Prepare daily OIDC publishing behind one repository approval variable. Verify metadata, allowlisted packed files, privacy, regression checks, npm and Bun release gates. The owner performs the first npm publish and trusted-publisher setup; keep approval unset."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:22:14.351Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T02:24:27.448Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:22:17.804Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:22:58.649Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:23:39.217Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-26T00:08:31.917Z",codex-agent,"Calendar-release inspection found that changelog:full and release:notes fixed the bootstrap date instead of deriving it from the selected package version. Replaced that fixed override with --date-from-version so later calendar releases retain matching changelog dates. The release workflow already derives its selected date and retains the existing decision logic. The calendar regression fails with the original scripts and passes 1/1 with version-derived dates."
  "2026-10-26T00:17:55.466Z",codex-agent,"Pack verification: npm pack --dry-run --json and the actual npm pack --ignore-scripts artifact agree on 216 allowlisted files (dist: 164; docs: 28; examples: 17; root files: 7). Every packed member was scanned for absolute home paths, npm/GitHub/cloud tokens, private keys, hosted-data locations, private addresses and historical owner email addresses: PASS with zero matches. Regression proof: five independent workflow mutations (approval, provenance, token environment, daily schedule and OR bypass) plus the original manifest each fail the new contract check; restored contract passes 4/4. The linked test also passes through pm test --run --progress. Next gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check with isolated HOME and Git configuration."
  "2026-10-26T00:49:46.117Z",codex-agent,"The first local npm gate hit the existing 300-second SIGKILL receipt-boundary test timeout under shared CPU contention. The release-readiness changes do not modify the controller or test budget. Inspecting and retrying that exact crash scenario unchanged; no timeout, source coverage threshold or case is being removed or raised. Full gate results remain pending and are not recorded as passing."
  "2026-10-26T00:55:11.213Z",codex-agent,"Opening the release-readiness PR so isolated GitHub CI can exercise both unchanged full release gates while local verification continues. The local npm run reached one 300-second crash-boundary timeout under shared host load; it is not counted as a passing gate. The same exact scenario is being retried without coverage to characterize the failure, and the complete gate will be retried with unchanged budgets. npm/Bun CI must pass before readiness is claimed."
  "2026-10-26T02:24:21.017Z",codex-agent,"Required complete npm run release:check and bun run release:check both PASS in isolated GitHub CI at 112788d6a1f6a270693770ece78df35e3f0e39cd. Main suite counts: npm 1026/1026, Bun 1026/1026; every required matrix job succeeded. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/40251686818. The first shared-host npm attempt exceeded the unchanged 300-second crash-boundary budget. The exact focused retry passed 1/1 in that budget. Later duplicate local work was stopped after complete isolated CI passed; no failed or interrupted local attempt is counted as a pass. No timeout, case, threshold or dependency pin was changed. Packed artifact allowlist/privacy checks and linked regressions passed. Final tracker evidence is being committed and CI will recheck that final head. Keep the item in progress for orchestrator verification."
